        <h2>Local help when you move home <em>in Northampton</em></h2>
        <div class="stage-practice"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>Chayce Properties is based on Kingsthorpe Road in Northampton, so a move in the town or elsewhere in Northamptonshire is coordinated by people who know the area. Whether you are leaving a family home in Kingsthorpe, Duston or Abington, or moving into a smaller property or retirement development nearby, we plan the whole move around you.</p></div>
        <p class="rx-sub">Many later-life moves involve downsizing after many years in one home. We help you decide what to keep, sell or pass on, pack with care, arrange the removal, liaise with your estate agent and solicitor, and help you settle in at the other end. One dedicated coordinator looks after the whole journey, so you and your family are not juggling several separate companies.</p>
        <dl class="gd-facts">
          <div><dt>Office</dt><dd>Unit F2B Barratt House, Kingsthorpe Road, NN2 6EZ</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Opening hours</dt><dd>Monday to Friday, 09:00 to 17:30</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Call us</dt><dd><a href="tel:+447708925432">07708 925432</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@chayceproperties.com">info@chayceproperties.com</a></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="rx-where">Arrange a visit or a phone consultation by calling or emailing us. Where to start: <a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">downsizing help for older people</a>, <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/elderly-move-manager-uk/">what an elderly move manager does</a> and our <a href="/services/">services</a>.</p>
